nano ~/pulseops/.gitignore
```

Replace everything with:
```
# Secrets
.env

# Mac junk
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Terraform - NEVER commit these
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.backup
terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/*.tfvars
terraform/override.tf
terraform/override.tf.json
terraform/*_override.tf
terraform/*_override.tf.json

# SSH Keys - NEVER commit
*.pem
*.key